OL,3,GNEWSAThames Water reports seven-borough
OL,4,Awater outage
OL,5,
OL,6,FAround 6,000 properties across five
OL,7,Fsouth London boroughs and two Surrey
OL,8,Fboroughs are experiencing no water or
OL,9,Flow pressure due to a burst water main,
OL,10,FThames Water has said.
OL,12,FThe company said its engineers were
OL,13,Fworking to fix the burst main in West
OL,14,FMolesey, after initially estimating
OL,15,Fthat 15,000 homes may have been
OL,16,Faffected.
OL,23,APub: 28-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
FL,324,320,200,140,0,100
