OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-$-%%%-!-%%%" ,%-$ -$%%-% ,,
OL,3,GNEWSAThames Water reports seven-borough
OL,4,Awater outage
OL,5,
OL,6,FEarlier, the company said customers in
OL,7,Fpostcode areas across Kingston upon
OL,8,FThames, Merton, Richmond upon Thames,
OL,9,FSutton and Wandsworth in London, as
OL,10,Fwell as Elmbridge and Spelthorne in
OL,11,FSurrey were impacted.
OL,13,FThames Water apologised for the lack of
OL,14,Fwater, adding: "Our specialist team is
OL,15,Fnow on site and working to stop the
OL,16,Fwater flooding from the broken pipe."
OL,23,APub: 28-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
